<div class="mast"><div class="en">NEW EDEN NEWS</div><div class="zh">新伊甸日报</div><div class="meta"><span>YC128 年 10 月 14 日 星期三</span><span>欧服 TRANQUILITY 版</span><span>售价 1,000 ISK</span></div></div>
<div class="banner"><span>号外 · 初出茅庐</span></div>
<div class="titles"><span>本报授予称号：</span><b>泡泡大师</b><b>战列舰老炮</b></div>
<div class="lead"><div class="photo"><div class="pic"><img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNkYPhfDwAChwGA60e6kgAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="Mika Tsukishiro" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block"></div><div class="cap">图：Mika Tsukishiro，摄于 Testville III - Fictional Academy</div></div><div class="txt"><h1 style="font-size:48px">保护期刚过：Mika Tsukishiro</h1><p class="lede">Hanako Kisaragi 是一名出色的独狼猎手。累计击毁 1,284 艘舰船，其中 331 次单杀。</p><div class="org"><div><i><img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNkYPhfDwAChwGA60e6kgAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block"></i>[MHL] Moonlit Harbor Logistics</div></div><div class="dos"><div>建号：EVE 2026-09-01（北京 2026-09-01）</div></div></div></div>
<div class="sep"></div>
<div class="grid"><div class="st"><b>3</b><span>击毁</span></div><div class="st"><b class="red">4</b><span>损失</span></div><div class="st"><b>1</b><span>单杀</span></div><div class="st"><b>37.5%</b><span>效率</span></div><div class="st"><b>12M</b><span>击毁价值</span></div><div class="st"><b class="red">20M</b><span>损失价值</span></div></div>
